        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Triminals is a traditional turn-based roguelike that combines squad tactics with deck-building gameplay. Players will form a squad of three unique characters, each with their own abilities, and embark from the Void beyond time and space to revisit their obscure pasts, defeat their enemies, and uncover the truth about time and destiny.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Features  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Your Way Through Chaos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689670/extras/9957bf8e30c54573c8ac865fa1682ad2.avif?t=1764225860\" width=1527 height=512 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, the decks of all three characters are shuffled together and drawn from collectively. Each character can use cards from any squad member’s deck.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters have different hand slots and abilities. Play cards or use other methods to alter the order of your hand,  and devise the optimal strategy to maximize each character’s effectiveness with the cards available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689670/extras/34c9bd89c7d2816dfb2b6a85e4ea5825.avif?t=1764225860\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire new cards and hand slots during your adventure. Combine these with each character’s unique abilities to shape distinctive combat styles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character features:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 30+ cards with varied effects  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 unique hand slots  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 7 talent skills that alter their playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Choices Along the Journey</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689670/extras/bb4b8e66360c51c4c15a30380f591241.avif?t=1764225860\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the vortex of memories and relive past decisions. Face diverse choices during your adventure to gain special permanent bonuses.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this game, these contents are waiting for you to discover:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8 unique characters, each with 7 special talent skills  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 240+ cards with unique abilities (and their 400+ upgraded versions!)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 160+ special hand slots to choose and combine (and their 300+ upgraded versions!)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Encounter and defeat over 50 types of enemies and bosses with different traits  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 40+ different encounter events offering special rewards  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5 progressively challenging levels leading to the final battle</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Triminals is a traditional turn-based roguelike that combines squad tactics with deck-building gameplay. Players will form a squad of three unique characters, each with their own abilities, and embark from the Void beyond time and space to revisit their obscure pasts, defeat their enemies, and uncover the truth about time and destiny.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Features  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Your Way Through Chaos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689670/extras/9957bf8e30c54573c8ac865fa1682ad2.avif?t=1764225860\" width=1527 height=512 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, the decks of all three characters are shuffled together and drawn from collectively. Each character can use cards from any squad member’s deck.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters have different hand slots and abilities. Play cards or use other methods to alter the order of your hand,  and devise the optimal strategy to maximize each character’s effectiveness with the cards available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689670/extras/34c9bd89c7d2816dfb2b6a85e4ea5825.avif?t=1764225860\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire new cards and hand slots during your adventure. Combine these with each character’s unique abilities to shape distinctive combat styles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character features:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 30+ cards with varied effects  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 unique hand slots  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 7 talent skills that alter their playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Choices Along the Journey</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689670/extras/bb4b8e66360c51c4c15a30380f591241.avif?t=1764225860\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the vortex of memories and relive past decisions. Face diverse choices during your adventure to gain special permanent bonuses.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this game, these contents are waiting for you to discover:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8 unique characters, each with 7 special talent skills  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 240+ cards with unique abilities (and their 400+ upgraded versions!)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 160+ special hand slots to choose and combine (and their 300+ upgraded versions!)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Encounter and defeat over 50 types of enemies and bosses with different traits  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 40+ different encounter events offering special rewards  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5 progressively challenging levels leading to the final battle</p>",
        "short_description": "The Triminals is a fantasy roguelike blending squad tactics &amp; deckbuilding. Lead 3 heroes through randomized adventures, collecting cards and making strategic choices in turn-based combat to unravel mysteries of time &amp; space.",
